{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "JER",
  "chapter": 9,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "JER.9.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.9.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Oh that my head were waters, and my eyes a fountain of tears, that I might weep day and night for the slain of the daughter of my people!",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.9.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.9.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Oh that I had in the wilderness a lodging-place of way-faring men; that I might leave my people, and go from them! for they ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " all adulterers, an assembly of treacherous men.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.9.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.9.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And they bend their tongues ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "like",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " their bow ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "for",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " lies: but they are not valiant for the truth upon the earth; for they proceed from evil to evil, and they know not me, saith the LORD.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.9.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.9.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Take ye heed every one of his neighbor, and trust ye not in any brother: for every brother will utterly supplant, and every neighbor will walk with slanders.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.9.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.9.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And they will deceive every one his neighbor, and will not speak the truth: they have taught their tongue to speak lies, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " weary themselves to commit iniquity.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.9.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.9.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thy habitation ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in the midst of deceit; through deceit they refuse to know me, saith the LORD.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.9.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.9.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Therefore thus saith the LORD of hosts, Behold, I will melt them, and try them; for how shall I do for the daughter of my people?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.9.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.9.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Their tongue ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is as",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " an arrow shot out; it speaketh deceit: ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "one",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " speaketh peaceably to his neighbor with his mouth, but in heart he layeth his wait.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.9.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.9.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Shall I not visit them for these ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "things",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": "? saith the LORD: shall not my soul be avenged on such a nation as this?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.9.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.9.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For the mountains will I take up a weeping and wailing, and for the habitations of the wilderness a lamentation, because they are burned up, so that none can pass through ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": "; neither can ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "men",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " hear the voice of the cattle; both the fowl of the heavens and the beast have fled; they are gone.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.9.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.9.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And I will make Jerusalem heaps, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a den of dragons; and I will make the cities of Judah desolate, without an inhabitant.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.9.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.9.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Who ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the wise man that may understand this? and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "who is he",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to whom the mouth of the LORD hath spoken, that he may declare it, for what the land perisheth ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " is burned up like a wilderness, that none passeth through?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.9.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.9.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the LORD saith, Because they have forsaken my law which I set before them, and have not obeyed my voice, neither walked therein;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.9.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.9.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But have walked after the imagination of their own heart, and after Baalim, which their fathers taught them:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.9.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.9.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Therefore thus saith the LORD of hosts, the God of Israel; Behold, I will feed them, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " this people, with wormwood, and give them water of gall to drink.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.9.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.9.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I will scatter them also among the heathen, whom neither they nor their fathers have known: and I will send a sword after them, till I have consumed them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.9.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.9.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thus saith the LORD of hosts, Consider ye, and call for the mourning women, that they may come; and send for skillful ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "women",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", that they may come:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.9.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.9.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And let them make haste, and take up a wailing for us, that our eyes may run down with tears, and our eyelids gush out with waters.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.9.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.9.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For a voice of wailing is heard out of Zion, How are we laid waste! we are greatly confounded, because we have forsaken the land, because our dwellings have cast ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "us",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " out.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.9.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.9.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Yet hear the word of the LORD, O ye women, and let your ear receive the word of his mouth, and teach your daughters wailing, and every one her neighbor lamentation.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.9.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.9.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For death hath come up into our windows, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " hath entered into our palaces, to cut off the children from without, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the young men from the streets.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.9.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.9.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Speak, Thus saith the LORD, Even the carcasses of men shall fall as dung upon the open field, and as the handful after the harvest-man, and none shall gather ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.9.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.9.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thus saith the LORD, Let not the wise ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "man",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " glory in his wisdom, neither let the mighty ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "man",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " glory in his might, let not the rich ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "man",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " glory in his riches:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.9.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.9.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But let him that glorieth, glory in this, that he understandeth and knoweth me, that I ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "am",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the LORD who exercise loving-kindness, judgment, and righteousness, in the earth: for in these ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "things",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " I delight, saith the LORD.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.9.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.9.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Behold, the days come, saith the LORD, that I will punish all ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "them who are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " circumcised with the uncircumcised;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.9.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.9.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Egypt, and Judah, and Edom, and the children of Ammon, and Moab, and all ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in the utmost corners, that dwell in the wilderness: for all ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "these",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " nations ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " uncircumcised, and all the house of Israel ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " uncircumcised in the heart.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
